{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_015_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b457d2d0e8d292a8500f63031712ceba0bd7f08f489bdcdd580db354ebe506c9",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_22:5_01_015_22_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55d7a747e6c8cd5159a779e0aa116284beb20e35b156922453678134087b055a",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー送的巧克力……！？哇啊！谢谢你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_22:5_01_015_22_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5bb5dd77a5a3e484a2d8459f9973b4c660cd711ed7e4f55a08c12c45826e539",
      "text": "上场前的紧张一下子全都飞到九霄云外啦！这个，我现在可以吃吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_22:5_01_015_22_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b746fb490cfd33528c37b829a741def4c401014772f4ee08e03bf3b9a6794bba",
      "text": "那我开动啦——！……超级好吃！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_22:5_01_015_22_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2121bff6528595bd678606a966077b2a85c70972bb95b187b8687c1f9eb473ac",
      "text": "总觉得力量源源不断地涌上来了。……欸？里面倾注了制作人的PASSION？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_22:5_01_015_22_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da970a84ae0b016e0b4f48a3ef23519f1dda421e9a20f9130fa1ab7550c503e5",
      "text": "原来是这样！嘿嘿，既然如此，接下来的工作肯定能大获成功！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_22:5_01_015_22_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b81d9ab27b94101daeb77f2181ebc6824e1ac781847958723730aa0ed9a2bc9",
      "text": "情、情人节巧克力……！？谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_22:5_01_015_22_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fb4e934f4950308e64426e51b58ec097d26dde37aa42151374f9d75a92a6cb5",
      "text": "嘿嘿，超级开心啊！居然能收到巧克力，今天真是幸运的一天！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_22:5_01_015_22_b:cmd-000025:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dcd50223c82a1a7f23c1db1aa71b0ff1c1999fb7b92e05b86a1179e7716def8",
      "text": "你能这么开心，我也很高兴！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_22:5_01_015_22_b:cmd-000026:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a27137d60cc386c0e75f5c0c5233158a25719f23893543785b63d080905b323",
      "text": "能让今天成为你的幸运日真是太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_22:5_01_015_22_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa7e2e66b9cbdc8aaf5373224a52d7532128b3df1fd8798668f07574567359ee",
      "text": "那当然会开心啦。因为我之前就在想要是能收到就好了嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_22:5_01_015_22_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c536ae5cb4c97c26305ce2362a0b4276336fa81495bcca82e71f647d087bdef",
      "text": "是啊，制作人真厉害！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_22:5_01_015_22_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa33d94575f07c0f7e77e49318858624daa758190e564db6196e897a2595bd53",
      "text": "这份巧克力，我会珍惜着吃的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_22:5_01_015_22_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af1bf0f7a0016567e3a845ced2ad633fb6ae718aaaa7d7ece6e8bb6fdc88957f",
      "text": "啊，不过要是带在身上的时候碰上什么倒霉事就糟了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_22:5_01_015_22_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c59c688e2007eb079e166e86e32494f32579f21d0303e63ce8156c51e9d26835",
      "text": "难得收到，我还是现在马上吃掉吧！这样就安全了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_22:5_01_015_22_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94b8d6088ba2a91682bcb84e6c8a81335ba2332530df983ff7d538e974f004bf",
      "text": "还能直接向●●●●プロデューサー 分享品尝感想，正是一举两得嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_22:5_01_015_22_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:419a9a223da5a818334f895ebd757b43708602df4ee2ff5be4e6749114983674",
      "text": "我开动了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
